# B8000-H built-in microphone: even at the top preamp step (30 dB) speech at
# 25 cm peaks near -23 dBFS, and voice messages came out very quiet. 150%
# (+10.6 dB in software) is loud enough without clipping on most taps on the
# case; 170% clipped them. Set at every start, after module-udev-detect.
.nofail
set-source-volume alsa_input.platform-b8000-mt6589-audio.b8k-mic 98304
.fail
